<div class="doc-section">
    <h2>CSS Variables</h2>
    <div class="doc-table-wrap">
        <table class="doc-table doc-api-table">
            <thead><tr><th>Variable</th><th>Default</th><th>Used for</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr><td>--nx-form-row-gap / --nx-form-column-gap</td><td>16px / 16px</td><td>The grid's gaps (ColumnSpacing overrides the column gap).</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-form-label-width</td><td>160px</td><td>The label column of a horizontal form.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-form-label-gap</td><td>6px</td><td>Between a label and its editor.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-form-group-gap</td><td>24px</td><td>Above a group that follows another.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>--nx-validation-color / --nx-validation-font-size</td><td>var(--nx-invalid) / 12.5px</td><td>Messages.</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <p class="doc-note">Grids fold to one column when the form is under 540 px wide (a container query, so a narrow dialog folds too).</p>
</div>

